.DS_Store
dist/
build/
# These two credential files are written by scripts/inject-secrets.mjs at
# build time DIRECTLY into netlify/functions/ (flat — no per-function
# subfolder, per that script's own header comment), not into a
# netlify/functions/<something>/ subdirectory. The old "*/firebase-..." /
# "*/google-..." patterns below required an extra path segment that never
# exists in this repo's real layout, so they silently never matched the
# actual files and provided no protection at all — confirmed directly with
# `git check-ignore -v` against the real flat paths. Fixed Sep 2026
# security pass. Kept broad (**/) so this stays correct even if the build
# script's output location ever changes.
netlify/functions/firebase-service-account.json
netlify/functions/google-service-account.json
**/firebase-service-account.json
**/google-service-account.json
*.local.json
